    72	
    73	"Wind. Bout, three to one."
    74	
    75	The Stone fourth-year stood a moment. Then he laughed, short and surprised, and put out his hand, and Lira shook it. Cael saw her say something to him he could not hear. He answered with a slow nod and a few words of his own.
    76	
