   170	
   171	Fiske went off to the water butt, and Lira turned back to her own line. All round the rim, thirty people discovered their own business again with great suddenness.
   172	
   173	Lira did not look after her. But on the walk back to the quadrangle she asked Cael, without turning her head, how long Fiske had spent collecting.
   174	
