editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/BOOK_MAP.md:320:**All canon names are approved and kept.** That includes the registry's flagged collisions (Halcenvane/Greyvane, Bracken/Brom, Wray/Greyvane, Vell/Velmere), which are not renamed in this edition. **Do not name existing unnamed roles:** the porter, the Ash Path instructor, the Mire Path instructor, the Lattice instructor and her pupil, the floor warden, the senior clerk, Gault's clerk, the adjudicating faculty, the Gold-tier fellow, the Shield Path fifth-year (41 wins), delegation counsel, **Withrow's counsel** (B6 makes her namelessness canon), the fire-watch, Vastin's mentor, and the collector Vastin helped end. **Brom's "man at the kitchen gate" stays unnamed by design.**
